        }
      ],
      "message": "http: stop processing requests from a client when send buffer is full\n\nPrevents a memory exhaustion case where a misbehaving client\nrefuses to read responses and drain the socket buffer. Instead of\npacking more data on to the server-side m_send_buffer, stop\ndispatching requests from the client to workers",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Matthew Zipkin",
